# Moddy Arena: a battle fought in Creative is not on the Champions board, and he is told so once, in chat; while he is
# in Creative the control panel's best line (his, by name) says his runs are not recorded. A battle he switches to
# Creative in and back is not recorded either, nor one he turns to Spectator in (which also takes him out of it, so
# that battle is lost). A battle in Survival all the way is recorded. Monsters are removed by command (the fighting is
# 4-battle-won's); a resistance effect keeps him on his feet.
# play-timeout: 1200
@intent a battle fought in Creative or Spectator at any point does not go on the Champions board and the player is told once in chat, while a battle in Survival all the way does
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step he arrives; nobody is on the Champions board yet
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty hard
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]

@step in Creative, the control panel's best line says his runs are not recorded
gamemode creative
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_best,nbt={text:{text:"Tester: in Creative, runs not recorded"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@aim pos 0.5 66.5 17.1
@wait 2s
@shot panel-best-in-creative

@step a battle started in Creative: he is told once, and it is not recorded
moddy arena start
@expect chat You are in Creative: this battle will not go on the Champions board. within 5s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:item_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_face_1]
@shot board-after-a-creative-battle

@step a Survival battle he switches to Creative in, and back: told once, not recorded
gamemode survival
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_panel_best,nbt={text:{text:"Tester: no best at these settings yet"}}]
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared within 10s
gamemode creative
@expect chat You are in Creative: this battle will not go on the Champions board. within 3s
@wait 1s
@shot told-when-he-switches
gamemode survival
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
gamemode creative
@wait 1s
gamemode survival
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title You won within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]

@step a battle he turns to Spectator in: told, out of it (so it is lost), and not recorded
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
gamemode spectator
@expect chat You are in Spectator: this battle will not go on the Champions board. within 3s
@expect title Battle lost within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_none,nbt={text:{text:"No champions here yet. Be the first!"}}]
gamemode survival
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 1s

@step a battle in Survival all the way goes on the board
moddy arena start
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 3 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title Wave 4 of 5 within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect title BOSS WAVE within 25s
@wait 1s
# wished waves (#55): a wave's monsters rise under pillars for 2 s; wait until they have all arrived
@repeat 60 until execute if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@wait 5t
@end-repeat
@wait 3s
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Your run: Won all 5 in within 10s
@expect chat The arena is tidy again within 20s
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_result_1,nbt={text:{text:"Won all 5"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_champions_name_1,nbt={text:{text:"Tester"}}]
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 0 0
@wait 3s
@shot board-after-a-survival-battle
